silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_03_the_transport_functor_named_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'TheTransportFunctorNamedConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the clinic-side image of Mittens, equal to ClinicPatient instance for this Mittens (the slot the clinic opened); also, the clinic chart record numbered 4419, image of the household's record 77 under transport; also, a derived anchor for the transport diagram: the clinic-side image of the household typed leg, carrying composition data.." .
